    <dashboard name='Story 1' type='storyboard'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='97260' id='9' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98614' x='693' y='1370'>
            <zone h='97260' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98614' x='693' y='1370'>
              <zone h='13527' id='4' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98614' x='693' y='1370' />
              <zone h='83733' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98614' x='693' y='14897'>
                <flipboard active-id='5' nav-type='arrowonly' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                  <story-points>
                    <story-point captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                    <story-point captured-sheet='Dashboard 1' id='2' />
                    <story-point captured-sheet='Dashboard 3' id='4' />
                    <story-point captured-sheet='' id='5' />
                  </story-points>
                </flipboard>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='86644' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='99048' x='0' y='11815'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Tableau Bold'>INTRODUCTION</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Tableau Bold'>YASH ANAND</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Dataset - </run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' italic='true'>Enviromental Impact</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>The dataset contains 50,000 records detailing key environmental metrics such as carbon emissions, water consumption, energy usage, waste generation, recycling rates, air quality index (AQI), and compliance levels. It spans multiple industries, regions, and product types, enabling detailed analysis and comparison. This structured data supports the visualization of environmental performance and helps identify trends, areas for improvement, and compliance status across different sectors.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>This story visualizes the environmental impact of industries and regions using key metrics like carbon emissions, water consumption, energy usage, recycling rates, and air quality.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>The aim is to </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>monitor</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>compare</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>, and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>analyze</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'> performance for strategic improvements in sustainability.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='90240' id='11' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='99567' x='173' y='9075'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Summary</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>This project visualizes key environmental impact metrics across industries, regions, and product types using an interactive Tableau dashboard. The dataset, containing 50,000 records, covers critical fields such as carbon emissions, water consumption, energy usage, waste generation, recycling rates, air quality (AQI), and compliance levels.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>The Tableau story is structured with the following visualizations:-</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Bar Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Displays total carbon emissions by region.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Line Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Shows trends in energy usage over time.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Heat Map:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Visualizes recycling rates across regions and industries.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Donut Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Displays the distribution of compliance levels (High, Medium, Low).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Scatter Plot:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Examines the relationship between carbon emissions and recycling rates.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Pie Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Illustrates carbon emissions share by each industry.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Tree Map:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Shows waste generated in each category.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Bubble Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Displays AQI values across regions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Histogram:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Highlights top 3 product types based on water consumption.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Lollipop Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Analyzes AQI (Air Quality Index) values across different regions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Text Table:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Displays the amount of energy used by industries in various regions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Stacked Bar Chart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Shows waste generated in each sub-category based on product type.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Two dashboards integrate these sheets:-</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Environmental Metrics Overview Dashboard:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Offers a high-level view of emissions, energy trends, recycling rates and insight about the relationship between carbon emissions and recycling rates .</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Advanced Analysis Dashboard:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> Enables deeper insights into compliance levels, emissions correlations, AQI, and water usage trends.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Advanced Analysis Dashboard:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>  Analyze the AQI(Air Quality Index) value in different regions , Energy Used by industries in different regions , Waste generated in each sub category based on Product type (in kg).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Interactive filters like </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Region</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Industry</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Product Type</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Compliance Level</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>, and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Time Period</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'> are used to allow dynamic data exploration.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>The goal is to enhance decision-making by providing actionable insights for improving environmental sustainability and compliance performance.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{EB87DB51-E383-4EBA-9EF1-83F1080F16FB}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
